      "description": "The name after Patient Name, Patient's Name, Pt Name, Patient Surname / Forename or Name of Patient (with or without ':' or '-', in any case): SMITH, JOHN A, John A. Smith, SMITH^JOHN (DICOM), one box a word. The label and a title (Mr, Mrs, Dr) stay visible; the name ends at the end of the line or before the next field.",
